+    ``__NGV2_LOOPBACK_RESULT__ <json>`` line. If it does not (namespace/listener setup
+    failed) and the run did not time out, this raises :class:`LiveRunnerError` -- it
+    NEVER degrades to a host-netns / outbound-open path.
+    """
